[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to an Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR) vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the application allows users to access and manipulate product data based on user-supplied identifiers (such as product names) without implementing proper authorization checks. Specifically, the endpoints for adding, downloading, and uploading products do not verify whether the user has permission to access or modify the specified product data. As a result, an attacker could potentially exploit this oversight to gain unauthorized access to or alter product information that they should not have access to, leading to data integrity issues and unauthorized data exposure.

